greetings to all,

i am a new subscriber and i am looking for cromemco system users.


my systems include 4 rack systems:

 1- 'home brew' slide rack w/ 3- 5.25" and 3- 8" rocker switch selected,
     6- 5.25" hd drives rocker switch selected, for testing and design
     prototyping.

 1- z2, 1- z2d, 1- cs200

terminals include; 3- cromemco mono, 1- cromemco color, 2- televideo,
4- various branded mono. do not recall model numbers.

7- 8" vc driven imi drives, various capacity.

20 plus- 5.25" hdd - imi, seagate, and another brand, various capacity.

8- 5.25" hdd corvus, various capacity.

200 plus- s100 cards, consisting of: 4fdc, 16fdc, 16kz, 16kpr,
          32k byte saver, 256kz, 1024kz, 4pio, 8pio, tu-art,
          quadart, sdi, smd, stdc, wdi-ii, xmm, xpu, xxu, dpu, zpu,
          and others, in various states of repair.

my original system was the slide rack, then the z2d. later bought z2 and
cs200 when local dealer went out of business and i scarfed up on the
hdd's and over 150 cards. [and why cards are in various states of repair]=


